      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Navy main navigation with visible Home, Games, and About Us links. Games stays visually active on its child pages.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><ul><li><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"/games\">Games</a></li><li><a href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li></ul></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--body,'EuroStyle',sans-serif);font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;font-synthesis:none;background:var(--navy,#091e2a);color:var(--paper,#fffdf7);font-size:1.125rem}.ds-nav ul{display:flex;gap:2.5rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:46px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;position:relative}.ds-nav a:after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:3px;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--sun,#e9aa2e);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-nav a:hover:after,.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]:after,.ds-nav a.ds-parent-active:after{transform:scaleX(1)}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-nav ul{gap:1.5rem}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{width:100%}.ds-nav ul{justify-content:flex-start;gap:2rem}.ds-nav a{font-size:1rem;min-height:44px}}@media(forced-colors:active){.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{text-decoration:underline}}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-text-link:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#f7c75d);outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button,.ds-text-link .ds-arrow,.ds-nav a:after,.ds-filter{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
