      "description": "Honest zero-video collection state with a useful follow-along link.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-empty\"><svg class=\"ds-video-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"10\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"m33 20 10-6v20l-10-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><h2>Still in the making.</h2><p>We’re busy bringing Trash Dash to life. Videos will join the collection when they’re ready to share.</p><a class=\"ds-text-link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/replayeverymemory/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Follow along on Instagram <svg class=\"ds-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-empty{font-family:var(--body,'EuroStyle',sans-serif);font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;font-synthesis:none;text-align:center;padding:4.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;background:var(--cream,#f5f0e4);color:var(--ink,#15313e);border-radius:16px;font-size:1.125rem}.ds-video-icon{display:block;width:50px;height:50px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;color:#805415}.ds-empty h2{font-family:var(--display,'Eurostile Extended',sans-serif);font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.5rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-wrap:balance;margin:0}.ds-empty p{max-width:43ch;margin:1rem auto;text-wrap:pretty}.ds-empty .ds-text-link{margin-top:1rem}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-empty{padding:3rem 1.25rem}}.ds-text-link{font-family:var(--body,'EuroStyle',sans-serif);font-weight:400;line-height:1.5;font-synthesis:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;min-height:44px;color:var(--ink,#15313e);text-decoration:none;font-size:1.125rem}.ds-text-link .ds-arrow{transition:transform .2s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-text-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-text-link:hover .ds-arrow{transform:translateX(4px)}.ds-arrow{display:block;width:1.3rem;height:1.3rem;flex-shrink:0}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-text-link:focus-visible,.ds-nav a:focus-visible,.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ad470c;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button,.ds-text-link .ds-arrow,.ds-nav a:after,.ds-filter{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}"
